.TH ZDOTS-VAULT-DOCTOR 1 "2026-08-03" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
zdots-vault-doctor \- Knowledge Layer curation: scores every markdown asset in PATH (default: this
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBzdots-vault-doctor --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
Usage: zdots-vault-doctor [PATH...] [options]

Knowledge Layer curation: scores every markdown asset in PATH (default: this
repo's own doc corpus) on cheap structural signals, bands into ok/watch/review/
address, and keeps a durable per-asset history. Local LLM is opt-in and last.

Options:
  --json             emit the current queue as JSON
  --llm               escalate the top-N flagged assets to ai-query for a clue
  --top-n N           how many to escalate with --llm (default 12)
  --cadence-days N    staleness threshold in days (default 180)
  --ack ID            acknowledge current findings for one asset
  --note TEXT         note to attach to --ack
  --history ID        print one asset's full event history
  --self-check        offline assertions on inline fixtures
  -h, --help          show this help
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
